vim-copilot Debian source package
================================

The public source package intentionally excludes the proprietary GitHub
Copilot language server.  A package built from it remains usable with a
server supplied through Vim's 'copilotcommand' option.

Do not download the server from debian/rules or any package build hook.  For
an approved internal build that bundles the server, copy the licensed,
architecture-matched executable to
runtime/copilot/copilot-language-server before creating the native source
package.  Keep its executable mode.  The resulting source package must be the
input to every clean-chroot build; injecting a server after source-package
creation invalidates reproducibility verification.

The distributor is responsible for confirming that bundling and redistribution
comply with GitHub's terms.  Public packages must continue to omit the binary.